lability Impact (A)**: L (Low) = 0.20\n\nThe base score is calculated as:\n\n`0.71 + 0.44 + 1.00 + 0.00 + 0.00 + 0.20 + 1.00 + 0.20 = 4.55`\n\n**Output**\n\nThe output will be in the format of a single JSON object.\n\n```\n{\n  \"attack_vector\": \"A\",\n  \"attack_complexity\": \"L\",\n  \"privileges_required\": \"H\",\n  \"user_interaction\": \"N\",\n  \"scope\": \"U\",\n  \"confidentiality_impact\": \"L\",\n  \"integrity_impact\": \"H\",\n  \"availability_impact\": \"L\",\n  \"vector_string\": \"CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:H/A:L\",\n  \"base_score\": 4.55\n}\n```\n\nNote that the output only includes the assessed metrics and does not include any explanations or additional information.",
